                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Wouldn't the name of the port depend on probing order?\n\nI usually refer to serial ports with paths like\n```\n/dev/serial/by-path/platform-fd500000.pcie-pci-0000:01:00.0-usb-0:1.1:1.0-port0\n/dev/serial/by-id/usb-1a86_USB_Serial-if00-port0\n```\n\nto avoid this issue.\n\nShould we refer by path or id instead and provide the appropriate example?"
